  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A small body is released from point&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></math> of smooth parabolic path <math><mi>y</mi><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>, where&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>y</mi></math> is vertical axis and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math> is horizontal axis at ground, as shown. The body leaves the surface from point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi></math>. If <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>g</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math> then what is the value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi></math>&nbsp;(in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>)?</p>\r\r<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\qt0009_bf847fa799fe.jpeg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 147px;\" /></p>\r"
  },
  "options": [],
  "correct_answer": "2",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"assets\\st0009_ef3b2253f948.jpeg\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 120px;\" /></p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn></msqrt><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><msup><mo>)</mo><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math><br /><math><mo>∴</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mi>g</mi><mo>×</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub></mrow></mfenced></msqrt></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><math><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">tan</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mtext>dx</mtext></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>H</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>d</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>g</mi><mo>&nbsp;</mo><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>u</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>cos</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⁡</mo><mi>θ</mi></mrow></mfrac></math><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mfenced><msqrt><mn>20</mn></msqrt></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mfenced><mstyle displaystyle=\"true\"><mfrac bevelled=\"true\"><mn>1</mn><msqrt><mn>5</mn></msqrt></mfrac></mstyle></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>5</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><msup><mi>d</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>d</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p>On solving we get&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>d</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>&nbsp;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math></p>"
